---
/** Story wrapper: every kind of content a post can hold, inside Prose. */
import Prose from '../Prose.astro';
import CodeBlock from '../CodeBlock.astro';
---

<Prose>
  <p>
    A paragraph with a <a href="https://example.com">link</a>, some <strong>bold</strong> and
    <em>italic</em> text, and <code>inline code</code>. Don't get me wrong, it's a lot for one paragraph.
  </p>
  <h2>A second-level heading</h2>
  <p>Here's what I do:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>An unordered item</li>
    <li>Another, with a <a href="https://example.com">link</a></li>
  </ul>
  <ol>
    <li>First step</li>
    <li>Second step</li>
  </ol>
  <h3>A third-level heading</h3>
  <blockquote>
    <p>I've missed out on a lot of moments where I could've been celebrating but my brain had already moved on.</p>
  </blockquote>
  <CodeBlock lang="js" code={`const wins = ['small', 'big'];\nconsole.log(wins.length);`} />
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Tool</th><th>Use</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td>AeroPress</td><td>Coffee</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Kobo</td><td>Reading</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <hr />
  <p>A closing paragraph after a rule.</p>
</Prose>
